ions in surface defect detection, such as unbalanced sample identification, limited sample size, and real-time processing.", "作者": ["Alireza Saberironaghi", "Jing Ren", "Moustafa El–Gindy"], "年份": 2023, "发表位置": "Algorithms"}}'}], 'model': 'DeepSeek-V4-Flash[free]', 'max_tokens': 4000, 'reasoning_effort': 'none', 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0}} | ctx={"client_host": "127.0.0.1", "method": "POST", "path": "/api/sessions/59ae8aeba9134b0ba378869f8b67ba6c/runs", "run_id": "run_231ba3eb233d42429012ba592f6bda0d", "session_key": "59ae8aeba9134b0ba378869f8b67ba6c", "turn_id": "082a16f9-6014-40f2-9263-ae8d12aee29c"}
