2026-08-01 12:21:52 | DEBUG    | openai._base_client | req=2a94b6b05b28 | Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/chat/completions', 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-1673167a-6091-48e1-a604-6cfc010ada5f', 'security': {'bearer_auth': True}, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'messages': [{'role': 'system', 'content': '你是论文综述分析助手。请先认真思考不同论文之间的关系，但最终只输出 JSON，不要输出 Markdown、解释文字或代码块。所有判断都必须带论文引用，引用格式使用 [paperId]。'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '{\n  "任务": "按子主题分析阅读节点产出的论文结构化摘要",\n  "用户综述主题": "港口集装箱损伤检测",\n  "子主题": "基于视觉的集装箱损伤检测",\n  "检索关键词": "(container damage detection and computer vision) or (container inspection and image processing)",\n  "允许引用的paperId": [\n    "10.3390/s19030644",\n    "2406.00239v1",\n    "2501.16662v2",\n    "2506.22517v1",\n    "10.1002/eng2.12852",\n    "10.3390/a16020095"\n  ],\n  "输出要求": {\n    "subtopic": "子主题名称，全局综合分析时填“全局综合分析”",\n    "search_keyword": "检索关键词，没有就填空字符串",\n    "paper_count": "本次分析覆盖的论文数量",\n    "paperIds": [\n      "本次分析实际使用的 paperId 列表"\n    ],\n    "subtopic_summary": "一段话概括研究现状，必须出现 [paperId]",\n    "研究现状": "和 subtopic_summary 含义相同，可以写得稍详细，必须出现 [paperId]",\n    "一致点": [\n      {\n        "point": "共识点",\n        "paperIds": [\n          "paperId1"\n        ],\n        "evidence": "一句话说明，必须出现 [paperId]"\n      }\n    ],\n    "矛盾点": [\n      {\n        "title": "矛盾点标题",\n        "positions": [\n          {\n            "claim": "某一方观点",\n            "paperIds": [\n              "paperId1"\n            ],\n            "evidence": "必须出现 [paperId]"\n          }\n        ],\n        "explanation": "这个矛盾目前怎么解释，必须出现 [paperId]"\n      }\n    ],\n    "研究空白": [\n      {\n        "type": "地区/时间/视角/方法/其他",\n        "gap": "空白说明，必须出现 [paperId]",\n        "paperIds": [\n          "paperId1"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    "时间线演化": [\n      {\n        "stage": "阶段名称",\n        "years": "年份范围",\n        "feature": "阶段特征，必须出现 [paperId]",\n        "paperIds": [\n          "paperId1"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    "技术方法栈演变": "方法从早期到近期怎么变化，必须出现 [paperId]",\n    "研究方法趋势": "主流研究方法怎么变化，必须出现 [paperId]",\n    "研究热度趋势": "近2-3年论文数量变化趋势和原因，必须出现 [paperId]",\n    "relationships": [\n      {\n        "relation": "与其他主题或变量的关系",\n        "paperIds": [\n          "paperId1"\n        ],\n        "evidence": "必须出现 [paperId]"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  "论文结构化摘要": [\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.3390/s19030644",\n      "title": "An Automatic Surface Defect Inspection System for Automobiles Using Machine Vision Methods",\n      "year": 2019,\n      "authors": [\n        "Qinbang Zhou",\n        "Renwen Chen",\n        "Bin Huang",\n        "Chuan Liu",\n        "Jie Yu",\n        "Xiaoqing Yu"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Sensors",\n      "abstract": "Automobile surface defects like scratches or dents occur during the process of manufacturing and cross-border transportation. This will affect consumers\' first impression and the service life of the car itself. In most worldwide automobile industries, the inspection process is mainly performed by human vision, which is unstable and insufficient. The combination of artificial intelligence and the automobile industry shows promise nowadays. However, it is a challenge to inspect such defects in a computer system because of imbalanced illumination, specular highlight reflection, various reflection modes and limited defect features. This paper presents the design and implementation of a novel automatic inspection system (AIS) for automobile surface defects which are the located in or close to style lines, edges and handles. The system consists of image acquisition and image processing devi...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用机器视觉方法自动检测汽车表面缺陷（如划痕和凹痕）？",\n        "methods": [\n          "多尺度Hessian矩阵融合方法提取候选缺陷区域",\n          "特征提取（形状、尺寸、统计和散度特征）",\n          "支持向量机（SVM）分类器"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "实验数据来自汽车表面图像，具体数据集未在摘要中明确说明"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一种新型自动检测系统（AIS），用于检测位于风格线、边缘和把手附近或内部的汽车表面缺陷",\n          "系统采用五台面阵CCD相机同步采集汽车五个侧面的图像",\n          "通过多尺度Hessian矩阵融合方法有效减少伪缺陷的误检"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "摘要未明确说明局限性"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "凹痕缺陷检测准确率为95.6%",\n          "划痕缺陷检测准确率为97.1%",\n          "系统适用于进口车辆的海关检验"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文提出了一种基于机器视觉的汽车表面缺陷自动检测系统，使用多尺度Hessian矩阵融合和SVM分类器，在凹痕和划痕检测上分别达到95.6%和97.1%的准确率。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 75,\n        "decision": "deep_read",\n        "reason": "论文主题与用户主题‘港口集装箱损伤检测’高度相关，均涉及表面缺陷检测，且方法（机器视觉、特征提取、分类器）具有可迁移性，值得深入阅读以借鉴其技术细节。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "2406.00239v1",\n      "title": "A Review of Pulse-Coupled Neural Network Applications in Computer Vision and Image Processing",\n      "year": 2024,\n      "authors": [\n        "Nurul Rafi",\n        "Pablo Rivas"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "Research in neural models inspired by mammal\'s visual cortex has led to many spiking neural networks such as pulse-coupled neural networks (PCNNs). These models are oscillating, spatio-temporal models stimulated with images to produce several time-based responses. This paper reviews PCNN\'s state of the art, covering its mathematical formulation, variants, and other simplifications found in the literature. We present several applications in which PCNN architectures have successfully addressed some fundamental image processing and computer vision challenges, including image segmentation, edge detection, medical imaging, image fusion, image compression, object recognition, and remote sensing. Results achieved in these applications suggest that the PCNN architecture generates useful perceptual information relevant to a wide variety of computer vision tasks.",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "脉冲耦合神经网络（PCNN）在计算机视觉和图像处理中的应用现状如何？",\n        "methods": [\n          "脉冲耦合神经网络（PCNN）的数学公式、变体及简化方法"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [],\n        "contributions": [\n          "综述了PCNN在图像分割、边缘检测、医学成像、图像融合、图像压缩、目标识别和遥感等计算机视觉任务中的应用"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [\n          "PCNN架构能够生成与多种计算机视觉任务相关的有用感知信息"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "本文综述了脉冲耦合神经网络（PCNN）在计算机视觉和图像处理中的最新进展，包括其数学公式、变体及简化方法，并展示了其在图像分割、边缘检测、医学成像、图像融合、图像压缩、目标识别和遥感等任务中的成功应用。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 20,\n        "decision": "insufficient",\n        "reason": "论文主题为PCNN在计算机视觉和图像处理中的综述，未涉及港口集装箱损伤检测，与用户主题不相关。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "2501.16662v2",\n      "title": "Vision-based autonomous structural damage detection using data-driven methods",\n      "year": 2025,\n      "authors": [\n        "Seyyed Taghi Ataei",\n        "Parviz Mohammad Zadeh",\n        "Saeid Ataei"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "This study addresses the urgent need for efficient and accurate damage detection in wind turbine structures, a crucial component of renewable energy infrastructure. Traditional inspection methods, such as manual assessments and non-destructive testing (NDT), are often costly, time-consuming, and prone to human error. To tackle these challenges, this research investigates advanced deep learning algorithms for vision-based structural health monitoring (SHM). A dataset of wind turbine surface images, featuring various damage types and pollution, was prepared and augmented for enhanced model training. Three algorithms-YOLOv7, its lightweight variant, and Faster R-CNN- were employed to detect and classify surface damage. The models were trained and evaluated on a dataset split into training, testing, and evaluation subsets (80%-10%-10%). Results indicate that YOLOv7 outperformed the others...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用基于视觉的深度学习方法实现风能涡轮机结构的自主损伤检测？",\n        "methods": [\n          "YOLOv7",\n          "YOLOv7轻量级变体",\n          "Faster R-CNN",\n          "数据增强",\n          "超参数优化（学习率、批量大小）"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "风能涡轮机表面图像数据集（包含多种损伤类型和污染）"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出并比较了三种深度学习算法用于风能涡轮机表面损伤检测",\n          "YOLOv7在检测精度（82.4% mAP@50）和处理速度上表现最优，适用于实时检测",\n          "通过超参数优化进一步提升了模型准确性和效率"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "数据集规模有限",\n          "环境变化（如光照、天气）对检测性能的影响"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "YOLOv7达到82.4% mAP@50",\n          "YOLOv7具有高处理速度，适合实时检测"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "本研究针对风能涡轮机结构损伤检测需求，采用YOLOv7、其轻量级变体和Faster R-CNN三种深度学习算法，基于增强后的涡轮机表面图像数据集进行训练和评估。YOLOv7在精度和速度上表现最佳，但存在数据集和环境变化等挑战。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 15,\n        "decision": "insufficient",\n        "reason": "论文主题为风能涡轮机结构损伤检测，与用户主题\'港口集装箱损伤检测\'不匹配，且摘要中未涉及任何港口集装箱相关场景或数据。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "2506.22517v1",\n      "title": "Container damage detection using advanced computer vision model Yolov12 vs Yolov11 vs RF-DETR A comparative analysis",\n      "year": 2025,\n      "authors": [\n        "Subhadip Kumar"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "Containers are an integral part of the logistics industry and act as a barrier for cargo. A typical service life for a container is more than 20 years. However, overtime containers suffer various types of damage due to the mechanical as well as natural factors. A damaged container is a safety hazard for the employees handling it and a liability for the logistic company. Therefore, a timely inspection and detection of the damaged container is a key for prolonging service life as well as avoiding safety hazards. In this paper, we will compare the performance of the damage detection by three state-of-the-art advanced computer vision models Yolov12, Yolov11 and RF-DETR. We will use a dataset of 278 annotated images to train, validate and test the model. We will compare the mAP and precision of the model. The objective of this paper is to identify the model that is best suited for containe...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "比较Yolov12、Yolov11和RF-DETR三种先进计算机视觉模型在港口集装箱损伤检测中的性能，以确定最适合该任务的模型。",\n        "methods": [\n          "使用Yolov12、Yolov11和RF-DETR三种计算机视觉模型进行集装箱损伤检测",\n          "使用278张标注图像的数据集进行训练、验证和测试",\n          "比较模型的mAP和精确度指标"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "278张标注图像的数据集"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "对三种先进计算机视觉模型在集装箱损伤检测任务上进行了系统比较",\n          "发现Yolov11和Yolov12在mAP@50上达到81.9%，优于RF-DETR的77.7%",\n          "发现RF-DETR在检测不常见损伤集装箱时表现更优，能高置信度地准确检测损伤集装箱和损伤发生"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "数据集规模较小（仅278张标注图像）"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "Yolov11和Yolov12的mAP@50得分为81.9%，RF-DETR为77.7%",\n          "RF-DETR在检测不常见损伤集装箱时整体表现优于其他模型"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文比较了Yolov12、Yolov11和RF-DETR三种模型在集装箱损伤检测中的性能，使用278张标注图像的数据集。Yolov11和Yolov12在mAP@50上达到81.9%，优于RF-DETR的77.7%，但RF-DETR在检测不常见损伤集装箱时表现更优。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 75,\n        "decision": "deep_read",\n        "reason": "论文主题与用户主题高度相关，提供了具体的模型比较和性能指标，但数据集较小且缺少部分细节，需要深入阅读以获取更全面的信息。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.1002/eng2.12852",\n      "title": "Autopilot control unmanned aerial vehicle system for sewage defect detection using deep learning",\n      "year": 2024,\n      "authors": [\n        "Binay Kumar Pandey",\n        "Digvijay Pandey",\n        "Kameshwar Sahani"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Engineering Reports",\n      "abstract": "Abstract This work proposes the use of an unmanned aerial vehicle (UAV) with an autopilot to identify the defects present in municipal sewerage pipes. The framework also includes an effective autopilot control mechanism that can direct the flight path of a UAV within a sewer line. Both of these breakthroughs have been addressed throughout this work. The UAV\'s camera proved useful throughout a sewage inspection, providing important contextual data that helped analyze the sewerage line\'s internal condition. A plethora of information useful for understanding the sewerage line\'s inner functioning and extracting interior visual details can be obtained from camera‐recorded sewerage imagery if a defect is present. In the case of sewerage inspections, nevertheless, the impact of a false negative is significantly higher than that of a false positive. One of the trickiest parts of the procedure...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用无人机和深度学习技术检测城市污水管道中的缺陷？",\n        "methods": [\n          "使用带有自动驾驶仪的无人机（UAV）进行污水管道缺陷检测",\n          "在预处理阶段采用引导图像滤波器（GIF）以减少假阴性和假阳性结果",\n          "使用Gabor变换（GT）和笔画宽度变换（SWT）提取无人机拍摄图像的特征",\n          "采用加权朴素贝叶斯分类器（WNBC）将污水管道图像分类为“有缺陷”或“无缺陷”",\n          "利用加速鲁棒特征（SURF）和深度学习分析无人机拍摄的污水管道图像以识别不同类型的缺陷"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "无人机在污水管道检查中拍摄的图像数据"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出了一种结合自动驾驶仪无人机和深度学习框架的污水管道缺陷检测系统",\n          "实现了有效的自动驾驶仪控制机制以引导无人机在污水管道内的飞行路径",\n          "通过引导图像滤波器预处理减少了假阴性和假阳性结果",\n          "在多个评估指标上取得了优于现有方法的结果"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "论文未明确讨论方法的局限性"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "平均PSNR为71.854",\n          "平均MSE为0.0618",\n          "平均RMSE为0.2485",\n          "平均SSIM为98.71%",\n          "平均准确率为98.372%",\n          "平均特异性为97.837%",\n          "平均精确率为93.296%",\n          "平均召回率为94.255%"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "该论文提出了一种基于自动驾驶仪无人机和深度学习的系统，用于检测城市污水管道中的缺陷。系统通过引导图像滤波器预处理减少误检，利用Gabor变换和笔画宽度变换提取特征，并使用加权朴素贝叶斯分类器进行分类，最后通过加速鲁棒特征和深度学习识别缺陷类型。实验结果表明该方法在多个指标上优于现有技术。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 75,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "论文摘要提供了清晰的研究问题、方法、数据集和结果，但缺少对局限性和具体实验细节的讨论，且用户主题为港口集装箱损伤检测，而论文聚焦于污水管道缺陷检测，主题不完全匹配，因此建议仅阅读摘要。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "10.3390/a16020095",\n      "title": "Defect Detection Methods for Industrial Products Using Deep Learning Techniques: A Review",\n      "year": 2023,\n      "authors": [\n        "Alireza Saberironaghi",\n        "Jing Ren",\n        "Moustafa El–Gindy"\n      ],\n      "venue": "Algorithms",\n      "abstract": "Over the last few decades, detecting surface defects has attracted significant attention as a challenging task. There are specific classes of problems that can be solved using traditional image processing techniques. However, these techniques struggle with complex textures in backgrounds, noise, and differences in lighting conditions. As a solution to this problem, deep learning has recently emerged, motivated by two main factors: accessibility to computing power and the rapid digitization of society, which enables the creation of large databases of labeled samples. This review paper aims to briefly summarize and analyze the current state of research on detecting defects using machine learning methods. First, deep learning-based detection of surface defects on industrial products is discussed from three perspectives: supervised, semi-supervised, and unsupervised. Secondly, the current...",\n      "structured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用深度学习方法检测工业产品表面缺陷？",\n        "methods": [\n          "监督学习",\n          "半监督学习",\n          "无监督学习",\n          "基于深度学习的X射线图像缺陷检测方法"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [],\n        "contributions": [\n          "从监督、半监督和无监督三个角度综述了基于深度学习的工业产品表面缺陷检测方法",\n          "讨论了基于深度学习的X射线图像缺陷检测方法的研究现状",\n          "总结了表面缺陷检测中常见的挑战（如样本不平衡、样本量有限、实时处理）及其潜在解决方案"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [],\n        "main_results": [],\n        "short_summary": "该综述论文总结了基于深度学习的工业产品表面缺陷检测方法，涵盖监督、半监督和无监督学习，并讨论了X射线图像缺陷检测，最后总结了常见挑战及解决方案。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 60,\n        "decision": "abstract_only",\n        "reason": "论文主题为工业产品表面缺陷检测的综述，与用户主题\'港口集装箱损伤检测\'相关但不够具体，且摘要中未提供具体方法、数据集或结果，仅适合作为背景参考。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    }\n  ]\n}'}], 'model': 'DeepSeek-V4-Flash[free]', 'max_tokens': 4000, 'reasoning_effort': 'medium', 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.2}} | ctx={"client_host": "127.0.0.1", "method": "POST", "path": "/api/sessions/59ae8aeba9134b0ba378869f8b67ba6c/runs", "run_id": "run_231ba3eb233d42429012ba592f6bda0d", "session_key": "59ae8aeba9134b0ba378869f8b67ba6c", "turn_id": "082a16f9-6014-40f2-9263-ae8d12aee29c"}
