ured_summary": {\n        "main_question": "如何利用基于视觉的深度学习方法实现风能涡轮机结构的自主损伤检测？",\n        "methods": [\n          "YOLOv7",\n          "YOLOv7轻量级变体",\n          "Faster R-CNN",\n          "数据增强",\n          "超参数优化（学习率、批量大小）"\n        ],\n        "datasets": [\n          "风能涡轮机表面图像数据集（包含多种损伤类型和污染）"\n        ],\n        "contributions": [\n          "提出并比较了三种深度学习算法用于风能涡轮机表面损伤检测",\n          "YOLOv7在检测精度（82.4% mAP@50）和处理速度上表现最优，适用于实时检测",\n          "通过超参数优化进一步提升了模型准确性和效率"\n        ],\n        "limitations": [\n          "数据集规模有限",\n          "环境变化（如光照、天气）对检测性能的影响"\n        ],\n        "main_results": [\n          "YOLOv7达到82.4% mAP@50",\n          "YOLOv7具有高处理速度，适合实时检测"\n        ],\n        "short_summary": "本研究针对风能涡轮机结构损伤检测需求，采用YOLOv7、其轻量级变体和Faster R-CNN三种深度学习算法，基于增强后的涡轮机表面图像数据集进行训练和评估。YOLOv7在精度和速度上表现最佳，但存在数据集和环境变化等挑战。",\n        "evidence_level": "abstract"\n      },\n      "relevance": {\n        "score": 15,\n        "decision": "insufficient",\n        "reason": "论文主题为风能涡轮机结构损伤检测，与用户主题\'港口集装箱损伤检测\'不匹配，且摘要中未涉及任何港口集装箱相关场景或数据。"\n      },\n      "full_text_status": "not_requested",\n      "extraction": {},\n      "warnings": []\n    },\n    {\n      "paperId": "2506.22517v1",\n      "title": "Container damage detection using advanced computer vision model Yolov12 vs Yolov11 vs RF-DETR A comparative analysis",\n      "year": 2025,\n      "authors": [\n        "Subhadip Kumar"\n      ],\n      "venue": "arXiv",\n      "abstract": "Containers are an integral part of the logistics industry and act as a barrier for cargo. A typical service life for a container is more than 20 years. However, overtime containers suffer various types of damage due to the mechanical as well as natural factors. A damaged container is a safety hazard for the employees handling it and a liability for the logistic company. Therefore, a timely inspection and detection of the damaged container is a key for prolonging service life as well as avoiding safety hazards. In this paper, we will compare the 